GlioMODA glioma segmentation
Canisius J, Buchner J, Rosier M, et al. GlioMODA: Robust Glioma Segmentation in
Clinical Routine. medRxiv. 2025. https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.11.12.25339968
Code: https://github.com/BrainLesion/GlioMODA (Apache-2.0)
Model weights: GlioMODA weights v1.0.2, Zenodo record 15625233, CC BY 4.0
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15625233
The fold_all checkpoints are converted to ONNX by scripts/export_model.py and
published separately on Hugging Face. model.manifest.json pins each file by
size and SHA-256.

Inference repeats nnU-Net v2.5.2's preprocessing and sliding-window prediction
(Isensee et al., Nature Methods 2021, Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/MIC-DKFZ/nnUNet

JavaScript port and packaging by Neurodesk, Apache-2.0.
